  [38;5;246m2.[39m Identity + change notification
     [38;5;246mAdds subscribe/notify so forms on the same page react to login/logout without a reload.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Identity + login history
     [38;5;246mAlso appends each login to a stored list. Needs a size cap; per-browser only, so not trustworthy as analytics.[39m
